# Post-change checks

After a refactor or adding new code:
- Run format and lint with `./run format --check` and `./run dev checks`
- Fix any problems until the run passes
- Run a build with `./run dev build` and unit tests with `swift test`; after visual changes, capture and look at `./run ui` screenshots
- Fix any errors or warnings until the run passes
- Do not report success to user, they will see the jobs run!
